# NOTE: We intentionally do NOT setcap CAP_SYS_NICE on kwin_wayland.
# A file capability makes glibc run the process in secure-execution mode
# (AT_SECURE=1), which makes the OpenXR loader ignore XR_RUNTIME_JSON and
# XDG runtime discovery — so xrCreateInstance fails with "no OpenXR runtime
# found" and VR mode cannot start with ANY runtime (Monado or WiVRn).
# For a VR compositor that trade-off is unacceptable; we forgo the realtime
# scheduling boost so VR can load its runtime. (A future option is to grant
# CAP_SYS_NICE via systemd ambient capabilities, which does not set AT_SECURE.)
post_install() {
  :
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
